'''Dragonheart''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

==Obtainment==
To unlock Dragonheart's crafting recipe, the player must obtain the [[Dojo Belt (Red)]]. However, in order to obtain the [[Dragon Egg]], an item required in the recipe, the player must have the [[Dojo Belt (Black)]], and the [[Dragon Tether]] ability, meaning they are unable to craft it right after they unlock the recipe.
