==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* High damage and [[AoE]].
* Very compatible with air PvP.

|'''[Z] Draconic Blitz'''
* Good combo starter.
* Decent mobility.
* Incredible hitbox (larger than the "dragon" itself).
* Good stun.
* The damage does not decrease as the move reaches its end, meaning that this move will still deal full damage even if it only hit on the last second.
* The "dragon" is quite easy to control.
* Compatible with air PvP.

|'''[X] Infernal Catastrophe'''
* Long range.
* Slight stun.
* Big hitbox.
* Good [[AoE]].
* Fast projectile, making it easy to hit moving targets.
* Useful to damage runners.
* Compatible with air PvP.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Difficult to obtain.

|'''[Z] Draconic Blitz'''
* Requires good vision to chain combos.
* Does not break [[Instinct]].

|'''[X] Infernal Catastrophe'''
* High mastery requirement.
* The damage and stun are dodgeable.
* When held, can be easily punished by long-range moves, such as {{Ability|Skull Guitar|Z}} as long as the player stays out of this move's range.
* Can be [[Instinct]] tricked.
* Has endlag.
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* Dragonheart was initially considered to be included in the new kit of the reworked [[Dragon]] fruit.
* Dragonheart is the only [[sword]] in the game that requires the player to craft it.
* Despite the recipe being available after obtaining [[Dojo Belt (Red)]], Dragonheart cannot be obtained until the player has [[Dragon Tether]] as it requires a [[Dragon Egg]].
* 500 [[Mastery]] is needed on this sword to light one of the lamps on [[Hydra Island]], which is required to obtain [[Draco]] V4.
* The sound of the M1 when hitting an enemy is the exact same as [[Dragon Talon]], [[Dragon Breath]], and [[Fox Lamp]]'s M1 sound effects.
* Similar to [[Dragonstorm]], this is the only sword having a {{w|Neologism#Background|compound neologism}} as its name. The term "Dragonheart" is not an English word and is the juxtaposition of the nouns "dragon" and "heart".
* {{Ability|X}}'s fire ring stays in place while moving on [[boats]].
** Those are also the only two [[weapons]] related to dragons and infernal power, with very similar textures and visual effects.
* The fiery effects from {{Ability|X}} is the same as [[Rengoku]]'s held {{Ability|Rengoku|X}}.
* If the user uses {{Ability|Z}} during high ping, the player will be able to fly for a short while, before teleporting back to the place where the user started the move.
